## Head kernel disassembly, `Q8_0` k-column row kernel

$ nm -S --size-sort target/release/examples/lookup_accept | grep q8_0_row_kcols
0000000000114440 00000000000009dc t _RNvNtNtNtCs7rPN1reWdmT_7apeiron6engine5chart19q8_0_row_kcols_avx2

$ objdump -d --start-address=0x114440 --stop-address=0x114e1c target/release/examples/lookup_accept
per 4-block group: 4 x (vpabsb, vpsignb, vpmaddubsw, vpmaddwd), one vphaddd reduction tree, then
4 scalar i128 scale multiplies and adds; 27 imul, 13 adc, 1688 instructions, IPC ~1.2.
